 <div class="sidebox"><h3>MODEL WEIGHTS</h3><span class="big">70 / 20 / 10</span><p>Statistics / physical profile / position. Lower distance means a closer measured profile, not greater basketball ability.</p></div>
 <div class="sidebox"><h3>LAST EPISODE</h3><p>Stockton's closest match scored 1.300, meaning Isiah's closest 2025–26 match is substantially nearer under these exact modeling choices.</p><p style="margin-top:10px"><a href="/research/stockton-time-machine/">Revisit Episode 01 ↗</a></p></div>
